@startuml SYSTEM_USE_CASES
top to bottom direction

title 전시 운영 시스템 유스케이스

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam linetype ortho

skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #64748B
    FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam usecase {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #7593FF
    FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #0F172A
    FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    BorderColor #64748B
    FontColor #0F172A
}

actor "관람객" as Visitor
actor "현장 직원" as Staff
actor "KOVAN" as Gateway
actor "미술관 담당자" as Manager

rectangle "전시 운영 시스템" as System {
    usecase "QR 티켓으로 입장" as Enter
    usecase "발권 키오스크에서\n관람권 발권" as KioskIssue
    usecase "티켓·영수증\n재출력" as Reprint
    usecase "POS에서\n관람권 발권" as PosIssue
    usecase "KOVAN 카드 결제" as CardPayment
    usecase "이벤트 생성" as CreateEvent
    usecase "매출 조회" as Sales
    usecase "발권·입장 통계 조회" as Statistics

    note right of CreateEvent
        운영 기간·시간과
        권종·가격을 함께 설정
    end note
}

Visitor -right-> Enter
Visitor -right-> KioskIssue
Staff -right-> Reprint
Staff -right-> PosIssue
Gateway -right-> CardPayment
Manager -right-> CreateEvent
Manager -right-> Sales
Manager -right-> Statistics

CardPayment .up.> KioskIssue : <<extend>>\n[유료권]
CardPayment .up.> PosIssue : <<extend>>\n[유료권]

' Hidden links keep the actors and use cases in reading order.
Visitor -[hidden]-> Staff
Staff -[hidden]-> Gateway
Gateway -[hidden]-> Manager
Enter -[hidden]-> Reprint
Reprint -[hidden]-> CardPayment
CardPayment -[hidden]-> CreateEvent
CreateEvent -[hidden]-> Sales
Sales -[hidden]-> Statistics
KioskIssue -[hidden]-> PosIssue

@enduml
